OL,3,ACanada to match Trump tariffs 'dollar
OL,4,Afor dollar' on $20bn worth of US goods
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanada announces $20bn of retaliatory
OL,7,Ftariffs on US goods as a trade war
OL,8,Fbetween the two countries escalates
OL,10,FMeasures beyond counter-tariffs to
OL,11,F"protect and support Canadian workers
OL,12,Fand businesses" are also being rolled
OL,13,Fout - watch live above
OL,15,FUS President Donald Trump yesterday
OL,16,Fthreatened to hike tariffs on Canadian
OL,17,Fvehicles to 50% from 1 January
